Subject: [PATCH] 56697: a reply that leaves a waiting plan without a question
 asks again
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The tester's 56697 (T4886 follow-up, 13 Oct, 2 of 3 fresh seats): after
„რატომ თამაზი?" about a proposed plan, the run answered the why and stopped,
with no question and no buttons. The plan's „ვადასტურებ / შევცვალოთ" belonged
to the reply that proposed it, so the owner had a decision still open and
nothing to tap. Now, on an owner's turn in a goal's thread whose proposed
plan is neither approved nor sent back for changes, a reply that asks nothing
and offers no buttons ends with the plan's own closing question („დავიწყო?")
and its two buttons. Existing words only. A reply with its own question or
its own buttons is left as it is.

